WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.752
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.703
SPEAKER: In an
existing GCP project,

00:00:08.703 --> 00:00:11.120
click the Cloud Shell icon on
the blue menu bar at the top

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.160
to show the Cloud Shell frame
at the bottom of your window.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.478
Type in gcloud projects list.

00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:18.770
Choose one of your projects
to use for this quick start

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:21.140
and note the project ID.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:26.240
Type gcloud config set project
followed by your project ID.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.370
Next, get the code for
the sample App Engine app

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:32.540
from GitHub using the link
included in the Quick Start.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.190
Now go into the newly
created directory

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:37.965
and deploy this app
with gcloud app deploy.

00:00:37.965 --> 00:00:39.590
You now have an App
Engine app running.

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:41.090
And you can check
it in your browser

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.800
to see that it's working.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.750
After you authenticate,
it greets you by name.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.610
Perfect.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:51.000
Next, you'll add Identity Aware
Proxy in front of this app.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.970
Go to the Navigation
menu to Security

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.860
to Identity Aware
Proxy, or click

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.840
the link in the Quick Start.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.580
Under all Web Services,
then under App Engine app,

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.550
you'll see the app
you just deployed.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:02.900
Select it.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.720
On the right side
panel, click Add Member.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.520
Add the email address
of a person or group

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:11.990
and choose IAP-secured web app
user for role under Cloud IAP.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:13.960
Then Save.

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.550
Use the IAP slider next
to the App Engine app line

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:19.400
to turn on IAP for this app.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.440
That account will still
see the same welcome

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.390
if logged in when browsing.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.430
Another account will get
an access denied error

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.050
as intended.

00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:28.015
Congratulations!

00:01:28.015 --> 00:01:30.140
Your application is now
protected by Identity Aware

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:33.440
Proxy and is only accessible
to the people you authorize.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.790
[MUSIC PLAYING]

